---
import { btnCls, cardCls, crumbCls, fieldCls, rangeCls, selectCls } from '../lib/ui';
// The table (#/expeditions/<key>/table): talk with a ship. Type a line and the sailing chosen answers it
// as "A:" after your "Q:" (thorp.table.reply, through server.py's POST /api/table/reply), at the
// temperature set; every exchange is kept in that sailing's transcript (thorp.table.transcript), and
// beside the talk are the ship's star and trick readings at its last checkpoint. Any finished ship
// can sit at the table, not only Table Talk's, so the table is open before Table Talk sails.
---
<div class="section" id="table">
  <h1><a class={crumbCls('back')} id="tableback" href="#/expeditions/table_talk">← expedition</a> The table <span class="q">talk with a ship: your line as Q:, its answer as A:, every exchange kept</span></h1>
  <section class={cardCls(false, 'panel')}>
    <div class="handtools">
      <label class="note" for="tablerun">ship</label><select class={selectCls('')} id="tablerun" title="the voyage at the table"></select>
      <label class="note" for="tabletemp">temperature</label><input class={rangeCls('')} type="range" id="tabletemp" min="0" max="1.5" step="0.05" value="0.8"><b id="tabletempv">0.80</b>
      <label class="note" for="tablemax">longest answer</label><select class={selectCls('')} id="tablemax"><option>50</option><option>100</option><option selected>200</option><option>400</option></select>
      <label class="note" for="tableseed">seed</label><input class={fieldCls('')} id="tableseed" placeholder="any" size="6" title="the same seed and temperature give the same answer">
    </div>
    <p class="note" id="tablehint">Low temperature: the ship's surest words. High: braver, stranger. The ship reads the last exchanges as the conversation so far. Ships not trained on the Q:/A: form don't converse yet: they carry on as if reading a book (a contents page, a poem). Table Talk's conversation stage is what teaches them to answer.</p>
  </section>
  <div class="tablegrid">
    <section class={cardCls(false, 'panel')}>
      <div id="tablelog" class="tablelog"></div>
      <form id="tableform" class="tableform" autocomplete="off"><b>Q:</b><input class={fieldCls('')} id="tableq" placeholder="say something to the ship"><button class={btnCls('outline', '')} id="tableask">Ask</button></form>
      <div class="note" id="tablestatus"></div>
    </section>
    <section class={cardCls(false, 'panel')}>
      <h2>The ship's readings <span class="note">its stars and tricks at the checkpoint answering you</span></h2>
      <div id="tablereadings" class="note">ask something to see them</div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
